---
source: crates/ccusage-cli-parser/src/tests.rs
expression: "help_text_for_args(&[\"ccusage\".to_string(), \"sync\".to_string()])"
---
Sync usage to a cloud storage bucket and publish the dashboard.

USAGE:
  ccusage sync <COMMANDS>

COMMANDS:
  run           Merge local usage into the bucket (the default)
  setup         Configure the bucket, credentials, and identity
  status        Show the resolved target, identity, and last sync
  doctor        Check credentials, bucket access, and clock skew
  repair        Rebuild the indexes and rollups from the shards
  forget        Delete one machine's data from the bucket
  merge-machine Move one machine's data under another machine id
  remove        Delete everything ccusage uploaded, and the buckets
  dashboard     Deploy the dashboard or mint a shareable link

For more info, run any command with the `--help` flag:
  ccusage sync run --help
  ccusage sync setup --help
  ccusage sync status --help
  ccusage sync doctor --help
  ccusage sync repair --help
  ccusage sync forget --help
  ccusage sync merge-machine --help
  ccusage sync remove --help
  ccusage sync dashboard --help
